{"name":"The Triple Bell","slug":"glyph-triple-bell","blurb":"On the trit street, Flint carries the bell toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Triple. Click the bell and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Triple Bell.","seal":"fa4580764ba411892188e37a4ee2903aa2a6bcfc08fc7fe27794707e420a79c4"}
